stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> DRAFT
 DRAFT --> PAYMENT_REVIEW
 PAYMENT_REVIEW --> LOCAL_COMMITTED: successful IndexedDB transaction
 LOCAL_COMMITTED --> SERVER_POSTED: server acknowledgement
 SERVER_POSTED --> [*]
 state Outbox {
 [*] --> PENDING
 PENDING --> SENDING
 SENDING --> ACKED
 SENDING --> RETRY: transient
 RETRY --> SENDING: same identity
 SENDING --> AUTH_REQUIRED: 401
 AUTH_REQUIRED --> SENDING: reauthenticate
 SENDING --> NEEDS_REVIEW: permanent conflict
 }
